  "name": null,
  "problem": "Consider the finite region $D$ enclosed in the first quadrant of the $xy$-plane between the curves\n\n$$\n{e}^{x}=\\frac{1}{y},\\,{e}^{x}=\\frac{3}{y},\\,y=x,\\,y=\\frac{x}{3}.\n$$\n\nA transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nmaps a rectangular region $Δ$ with sides parallel to the $u$- and $v$-axes from the $uv$-plane onto $D$ in the $xy$-plane. Given that\n\n$$\n{T}^{-1}:(x,y)\\to (\\,\\bbox[5pt,white,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{AA}}\\,,\\,\\frac{x}{y}),\n$$\n\nwhat could be the missing expression?",
